        "note": {
          "id": 4039457611,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Hi @phikai, just a sanity check as you are familiar with the external binaries (orbit, duo cli). Is there a use case for being able to configure the binaries locally? With this MR we would only be able to configure `duo_cli_binary_path` and `orbit_cli_binary_path` (and related configs) globally. I think this makes sense but just wanted a sanity check.",
